<title>USA: Global Industries Ltd Q2 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Global Industries Ltd Q2 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, La. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data and days)</p>
<p>    Quarter ended September 30,		  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Contract revenues				$ 72,431   $ 45,362</p>
<p> Operating income				   18,190     12,535</p>
<p> Net income					   12,517	8,198</p>
<p> Average shares(a)				  39,567     38,412</p>
<p> Net income per share(a)			    0.32	 0.21</p>
<p>    Six months ended September 30,	     1996	  1995</p>
<p> Contract revenues				$122,763   $ 77,157</p>
<p> Operating income				   27,573     18,462</p>
<p> Net income					   19,160     12,328</p>
<p> Average shares(a )				 39,476     38,348</p>
<p> Net income per share(a)			    0.49	 0.32</p>
<p>(a)  After giving effect to the two-for-one, common stock splits effected in January 1996 and August 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
